/**
 * Canonical StockSense demo dataset.
 *
 * The Steel Rods narrative is the spine of the demo and is deliberately left at
 * zero so the evaluator can walk it end to end:
 *
 *   RC-1001 receive 100 kg  →  Central Warehouse 100
 *   TR-2001 transfer 100 kg →  Central 0 · Production Rack 100 · total 100
 *   DL-3001 deliver 20 kg   →  Production Rack 80 · total 80
 *   count 77, book 80       →  ADJ-4001 difference −3
 *   ADJ-4001 posted         →  Production Rack 77 · total 77
 *
 * Everything else in the dataset is generated by replaying a movement history
 * through `HistoryBuilder`, so the stock map, the ledger running balance and the
 * document list can never disagree. The builder fails loudly at boot if a
 * movement would drive a leaf below zero.
 */
